\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The night is come, wherein at last we rest;
\par God order this and all things for the best:
\par Beneath His blessing fearless we may lie,
\par Since He  is nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Drive evil thoughts and spirits far away;
\par Master, watch o'er us till the dawning day,
\par Body and soul alike from harm defend,
\par Thine angel send.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Let holy prayers and thoughts our latest be;
\par Let us awake with joy still close to Thee,
\par In all things serve Thee, in each deed and thought
\par Thy praise be sought.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Give to the sick as Thy beloved sleep,
\par And help the captive, comfort those  who weep,
\par Care for the widows' and the orphans' woe
\par Keep far our foe.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. For we have none on whom for help to call,
\par Save Thee, O God in heaven, who car'st for all,
\par And wilt forsake them never, day or night,
\par Who love Thee right.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Father, Thy name be praised, Thy kingdom come,
\par Thy will be wrought as in our heavenly home;
\par Keep us in life, forgive our sins, deliver
\par Us now and ever.
\par                  Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

